</div>
<div style="flex: 1;">
<p style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 2px;">Wagenknecht</p>
</div>
</div>
Strength: [+ oldleft_strength : strength +] <br>
Dissent: [+ oldleft_dissent : dissent +] <br>

